      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 8 months ago",
      "body": "You would go away with your baby?\nWe go away every year with DFs family and when dd was born i said i wanted her to be about 3mths old so she was in a routine before we went away.\nI'm doing the same with this baby too!\nBut i couldnt take a child abroad until they were on proper food, off baby milk and toilet trained and speaking! Only coz i dont like travelling abroad and at leat then if they are ill then can tell me and its easier to find them soemthing to eat! but im a whimp!",
